<title>USA: Lumberton Township, N.J. won by PNC Securities.</title>
<headline>Lumberton Township, N.J. won by PNC Securities.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>PNC Securities Group said it won $4.019 million of Lumberton Township, N.J., general obligation bonds, Series 1996A, with the lowest rate of 5.660, highest price of 100.2583.</p>
</text>
